    <marc:datafield tag="505" ind1="0" ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Who are the happy retirees, and what makes them happy? -- What makes retirees unhappy and how can you avoid it? -- Can I really retire sooner than I think? -- Secret #1: determine what you want and need your retirement money for -- Secret #2: figure out how much money you need to save before you retire -- Secret #3: pay off your mortgage in as little as five years -- Secret #4: develop an income stream from three or four sources, not just one -- Secret #5: become an income investor -- How risky can you be?: come up with the right mix of stocks, bonds, real estate, and cash -- Avoid the major pitfalls of investing -- Hobbies, recreation, vacations, and so much more.</marc:subfield>
    </marc:datafield>
